{"ts":"2026-08-03T17:04:45.941Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"a84422ec7f16bada67f6516e","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-4uplae"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-882: unresolved extension commands must lead with the activation failure and actionable recovery"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"When an installed extension declares the requested command but module activation fails, unresolved-command recovery currently reports a false Unknown command diagnosis, recommends typo hunting, and prints the detected root cause last without actionable dependency repair. This is a regression/follow-up to the closed activation-diagnostics lineage, not a duplicate: the structured failure exists but the command-boundary classifier and ordering remain wrong."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:cli","area:sdk","extensions","gh-issue","recovery","regression"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-03T17:04:45.941Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-03T17:04:45.941Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Unknown-command classification consults static installed contribution data and activation failures before typo recovery; module-resolution failures render bounded non-secret install recovery; structured JSON and human output agree; isolated clone-like extension acceptance is covered."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-ugqx"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Install a project extension, remove its node_modules, then invoke one of its declared commands."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"If a requested command is declared by an installed extension whose activation failed, the error identifies that extension and failure first, provides safe reinstall or dependency recovery, preserves the attempted command, and avoids known-wrong typo remediation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The CLI reports Unknown command, recommends pm --help and alternate paths, then appends the real module-resolution activation failure after the recovery bundle without a repair command."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.8.3"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"extension activation recovery"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/regression","value":true},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-021kdp","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-03T17:04:45.941Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-3ljt19","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-03T17:04:45.941Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-j0w7j9","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-03T17:04:45.941Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-ugqx","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-03T17:04:45.941Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-yffj","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-03T17:04:45.941Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-03T17:04:45.941Z","author":"harness:codex","text